      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1atuwc9'
    '|b||And whether a kidney or a vote should ever be for sale, no study can settle. That''s a question of values, and it stays open.':
